.TH SDL_DisableScreenSaver 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_DisableScreenSaver \- Prevent the screen from being blanked by a screen saver.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_video.h>
.PP
.BI "bool SDL_DisableScreenSaver(void);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
If you disable the screensaver, it is automatically re-enabled when SDL quits\[char46]
.PP
The screensaver is disabled by default, but this may by changed by
.BR SDL_HINT_VIDEO_ALLOW_SCREENSAVER \[char46]

.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns true on success or false on failure; call
.BR SDL_GetError ()
for more information\[char46]

.SH THREAD SAFETY
This function should only be called on the main thread\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

.SH SEE ALSO
.BR SDL_EnableScreenSaver (3),
.BR SDL_ScreenSaverEnabled (3)
